# Masha, Wild-oats Fist

> Masha is not the side-lane split-pusher she used to be. The 2.2.16 rework turned her into a berserker who opens a Wound with a skill, tears it with one basic attack, and enters Feral, where her claw strikes hit an area and heal her as they land. She only pays off in fights the enemy cannot walk out of.

